WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500 align:middle line:90%

2
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.970 align:middle line:84%
On some of my projects, I want
an announcement to show up

3
00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:04.510 align:middle line:90%
on the Overview page.

4
00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:06.720 align:middle line:84%
To do that, I'll go to
the Project Settings link

5
00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.880 align:middle line:84%
here and look for
the section called

6
00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:11.070 align:middle line:90%
"Overview Page Announcement."

7
00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:14.500 align:middle line:84%
Let's just put
some text in there

8
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.870 align:middle line:84%
and then click Save at
the bottom of the page.

9
00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:20.200 align:middle line:84%
Now everyone in the project
can see that message

10
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.320 align:middle line:90%
on the Overview tab.
